    <data key="d0">BookMyShow Data Platform Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RU__HBEMDvQ</data>
    <data key="d2">Handles over 250 million users and 5 billion page views monthly. Reduced data architecture costs by 70% compared to on-premises using serverless and auto-scaling transient EMR spot instances.</data>
